# Where the built site sends API calls and loads media from (src/utils/endpoints.js). Read by the Dockerfile before
# `npm run build`, because `gcloud run deploy --source` cannot pass build args. Changing these two lines is the whole
# cut-over and the whole rollback (docs/SPLIT_CUTOVER.md); no code changes.
#   empty      = today's single service: /api and /plugins/... on subverselab.com itself
#   split      = VITE_API_BASE=https://api.subverselab.com
#                VITE_MEDIA_BASE=https://storage.googleapis.com/subverselab-media
VITE_API_BASE=
VITE_MEDIA_BASE=
